d></td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">一、填空题。（每空1分，共19分）</div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n      <span class=\"num\">1.</span>地球年需要有15000400 公顷的森林被毁掉，横线上的数读作（<span class=\"blank\"></span>）\n      <span class=\"line\">公顷，改写成用“万”作单位的数是（<span class=\"blank\"></span>）公顷，用“四舍五入”法省略万位后</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">面的尾数约是（<span class=\"blank\"></span>）公顷。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n      <span class=\"num\">2.</span>某石拱桥旁水位是5 m，把超过5 m 的部分用正数表示，把低于5 m 的部分用负数\n      <span class=\"line\">表示。一场暴雨后，水位上升到6.2 m，应记作（<span class=\"smallblank\"></span>）m;第二天水位下降到4 m，</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">就记作（<span class=\"smallblank\"></span>）m。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n      <span class=\"num\">3.</span>$\\frac{2}{7}$的分数单位是（<span class=\"smallblank\"></span>），它有（<span class=\"smallblank\"></span>）个这样的分数单位，它的倒数是（<span class=\"smallblank\"></span>）。\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question\">\n      <span class=\"num\">4.</span>$a\\div b=3(a,b都是不为0的自然数)$，则 a 和 b 的最大公因数是（<span class=\"smallblank\"></span>），最小公倍数\n      <span class=\"line\">是（<span class=\"smallblank\"></span>）。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"question q5\">\n      <span class=\"num\">5.</span>右面是一个长方体纸盒的展开图，这个纸盒的表面积是（<span class=\"smallblank\"></span>）\n      <span class=\"line\">（<span class=\"smallblank\"></span>）cm²，体积是（<span class=\"smallblank\"></span>）cm³。</span>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder box-net\">\n        <svg width=\"105\" height=\"41\" viewBox=\"0 0 105 41\" aria-label=\"长方体展开图\">\n          <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n            <rect x=\"28\" y=\"4\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\"></rect>\n            <rect x=\"52\" y=\"4\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\"></rect>\n            <rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\"></rect>\n            <rect x=\"28\" y=\"22\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\"></rect>\n            <rect x=\"52\" y=\"22\" width=\"27\" height=\"15\"></rect>\n        